4. System Architecture
The definitive ownership model below applies the later explicit project decision to the agenda's broader Python/MQL5 division. The agenda contains an internal tension: its conceptual high-level flow names a Python decision/research engine, while it simultaneously says MQL5 is final execution/hard-risk authority. The current project decision resolves this by keeping the trading decision logic inside MQL5 and restricting Python to external information/data provision.
