12. Live-Trading Architecture
The documented live sequence is retained with ownership corrected to the governing MQL5-core principle: MT5 supplies the live market/broker state; MQL5 creates the canonical snapshot; Python supplies only external information; MQL5 updates/validates context, performs regime/strategy/risk logic, and makes the final decision; MQL5 executes and manages positions.
